# Claude Code creates isolated worktrees in here. Each one is a separate
# checkout of this repo, so `git add` records it as a phantom submodule
# (mode 160000) instead of the files inside it - which is how a commit ends
# up holding a broken link and none of the actual work. Never track them.
.claude/worktrees/
